{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#card-zh","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebrowser 是面向 DSH Desktop 的侧边栏浏览器插件，让 Agent 在当前会话中观察并操作用户打开的网页。它通过 Host 与 Client 的 Inspect 通道连接 DSH 侧栏中的浏览器页面，提供标签页查看、页面快照、定向读取、原生输入操作、导航、截图和视口调整；还可提取已渲染的链接、标题、表格与列表，并提供控制台、网络、元素样式、性能和存储诊断。适合需要让 Agent 处理网页或排查页面问题的 DSH Desktop 用户。需要桌面端侧边栏浏览器和 Agent 会话；Web profile 的跨域 iframe 不支持读取或操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-14","src/features.js:7-22","client.js:4701-4705"]}
{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#card-en","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebrowser lets an agent use DSH Desktop's sidebar browser to inspect pages, interact, navigate, capture screenshots, extract rendered data, and diagnose console or network issues. Requires a desktop sidebar browser and agent session; cross-origin Web profile iframes are unsupported.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-14","src/features.js:7-22","client.js:4701-4705"]}
