{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#feature-1","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebrowser 的功能「观察并操作侧栏网页」：Agent 可查看页面快照和交互元素，再执行点击、输入、滚动等操作。工具通过当前会话连接侧栏中的页面，并可在动作后附加新观察。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-14","src/features.js:12-22"]}
{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#feature-2","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebrowser 的功能「提取网页内容」：Agent 可从当前已渲染页面提取链接、标题、表格行或列表项，并可用选择器限定范围；结果以有界数据返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/features.js:17-22"]}
{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#feature-3","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebrowser 的功能「页面调试诊断」：Agent 可启动或停止采集，再读取控制台和网络记录，也能检查元素、样式、性能、站点存储及页面变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/debug-schema.js:1-20","client.js:4698-4705"]}
{"unit_id":"AsakuraAOI__dsh-sidebrowser#feature-4","repo":"AsakuraAOI/dsh-sidebrowser","commit":"d912e18235baa23c171318652e1de7c2705a8abb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebrowser 的功能「调整侧栏视口」：用户可通过侧栏标签菜单或快捷键切换网页视口预设；Client 侧控制器会把所选尺寸应用到已挂载的浏览器标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4710-4712","client.js:4757-4780"]}
